		TEXTP
	POPF
		PT1
	FLPUT		/SET THE VARIABLE
		ACX
	TSTEND		/END OF VARIABLE LIST?
	SKP
	JMP I INREAD	/YES: DONE
	TSTCOM		/COMMA SEPARATOR?
ERR500,	ERROR		/NO: ILLEGAL SYNTAX IN INPUT OR READ
	GETC		/SKIP OVER THE COMMA
	JMP INRVAR	/GO DO THIS VARIABLE
