/RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR
/NOTE: THIS "RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR" WAS WRITTEN
/WITHOUT AN ALGORITHM, SO IT IS NOTHING VERY
/SPECIAL.  IF ANYONE FEELS LIKE CHANGING IT, BE MY GUEST.
RND,	0
	TAD FRNDX+1
	CLL RAL
	TAD FRNDX+2
	DCA ACX
	TAD FRNDX+1
	RAL
	TAD FRNDX+1
	TAD FRNDX+2
	DCA ACLO
	TAD FRNDX
	RAL
	TAD FRNDX
	JMP I (RND1	/JUMP TO REST OF FUNCTION
