	DCA	OPX
	ISZ	AC2	/MOVE POINTER TO HI MANTISSA WD
	TAD I	AC2	/PICK IT UP
	DCA	OPH	/STORE
	ISZ	AC2	/MOVE PTR. TO LO MANTISSA WD.
	TAD I	AC2	/PICK IT UP
	DCA	OPL	/STORE IT
	JMP I	ARGET	/RETURN
