COM6,	AND (77		/CHOP OFF THE LEFT HAND GARBAGE
	SNA		/END OF KEYWORD?
	JMP COM4	/YES: KEYWORD FOUND
	TAD (40		/ADJUST TO ASCII
	CIA
	CDF 0
	TAD I (CHAR	/CHARACTOR FROM PROGRAM TEXT
	SNA CLA		/MATCH?
